# OPUS-NODATA-20260929-03 (Q52, the author: "у s нет поля y, оно у ROOT"; GATE: `ROOT\y = 0`, `s\y` does not exist): s
# writes its hidden input y bare -- the declaration of y is the root's, s has no field y, so the path s\y names nothing
# and is refused where it stands.  (ROOT\y = 0 after the call: unit_sub_return_trailer.)
int: y 0
sub: s ()
    y: y + 3
    return
s
int: v 0
v: s\y
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: v; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
